            "`alloc(n)` calls `map_normal` when `Sz == page_size` and `map_large` when `Sz == large_page_size`. Other values have no mapping branch and fail. A null or Linux error-pointer result reports `critical_error`. The subsequent `madvise(..., madv_dontneed)` result is ignored.",
